    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Full 8-Module + SecurityTest Integration Specification</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">M</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Standardize the entire Report-5.2 document to match Report-5.2_Integration Test_SEP490_G141.xlsx template (140 Feature TCs + 16 Security TCs = 156 TCs) and split into 9 per-module specification files.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Report-5.2_Integration Test_SEP490_G141.xlsx</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-16</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 09 (M15_Governance) Integration Test Suite</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add 16 Integration Test Cases (ITC-GOV-001 -&gt; ITC-GOV-016) covering 19 REST APIs (STT 150-168) of the Account, Staff &amp; System Governance / Analytics module (GovernanceTests.cs), bringing total to 172 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">09_integration_test_account_staff_system_governance_analytics.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-17</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 10 (M12_ServicePackages) Integration Test Suite</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add 16 Integration Test Cases (ITC-PAY-001 -&gt; ITC-PAY-016) covering 15 REST APIs (STT 115-129) of the In-System Service Packages &amp; VietQR Integration module (ServicePackageTests.cs), bringing total to 188 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">10_integration_test_in_system_service_packages_vietqr.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-17</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 11 (M13_AiCuration) Integration Test Suite</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add 16 Integration Test Cases (ITC-CLS-001 -&gt; ITC-CLS-016) covering 10 Core APIs (STT 130-139), upgrades to 021, 024 and FastAPI (STT 183-184) of the AI Misclassification Feedback &amp; Dataset Curation module (AiCurationTests.cs), bringing total to 204 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">11_integration_test_ai_misclassification_feedback_dataset_curation.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-18</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 12 (M11_ReviewsComplaints) Integration Test Suite</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add 16 Integration Test Cases (ITC-RVW-001 -&gt; ITC-RVW-016) covering 12 REST APIs (STT 103-114) of the Rating, Review &amp; Complaint Resolution module (ReviewsAndComplaintsTests.cs), bringing total to 220 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">12_integration_test_rating_review_complaint_resolution.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-19</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.5</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 13 (M10_Gamification) &amp; Module 14 (M14_BlogContent)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add 20 Integration TCs (ITC-GAM-001 -&gt; ITC-GAM-020) for M-10 (27 APIs STT 076-102, GamificationTests.cs) and 16 Integration TCs (ITC-BLG-001 -&gt; ITC-BLG-016) for M-14 (10 APIs STT 140-149, BlogTests.cs), bringing total to 256 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">13_integration_test_gamification_and_rewards.md, 14_integration_test_blog_and_content_management.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Module 02 (STT 025-031) &amp; System Notifications (M-15)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Add scan history, master category/Rule Engine Publish management (ITC-AI-016 -&gt; ITC-AI-020) and 4 Notification Integration TCs (ITC-GOV-017 -&gt; ITC-GOV-020, NotificationTests.cs) + SignalR /hubs/notifications, bringing total to 265 TCs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">02_integration_test_ai_classification_and_rule_engine.md, 09_integration_test_account_staff_system_governance_analytics.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="232">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">1.7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Full Live Codebase Sync (218 Canonical APIs, 283 TCs, 517 Methods / 707 xUnit Cases)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">M</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Synchronize full specifications with live codebase: Dual Auth Cookie+JWT &amp; Role Sync (M-01); YOLO26 Two-Stage (yolo26_detect) &amp; 10 waste categories + 16 FastAPI endpoints &amp; non-purchasable category pricing guard BR-MTH-03 (ITC-SCN-021..022); 30-day appointment window (ITC-HND-023); receipt/upload-proof &amp; TradeOrder sync (ITC-RCP-021); IsInquiryOnly inquiry draft &amp; chat thread enrichment (ITC-NEG-016..017); 6 PlatformPoliciesController APIs (ITC-GOV-021..024); 4 ProEligibilityReportDto criteria &amp; stale JWT role sync (ITC-PAY-017..018); tree/care, tree/harvest, gift upload/restock, cycle edit/activate &amp; config reset (ITC-GAM-021..024); Staff detail/recall &amp; dedicated Admin approve/reject (ITC-BLG-017..018). Bring total to 283 / 283 TCs &amp; cross-reference 15 .cs files (517 methods / 707 xUnit cases).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">EcoLink.ApiTests.csproj, 00_api_inventory_and_endpoint_statistics.md</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="20">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="5" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">Note: *A = Added, D = Deleted, M = Modified</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
