   </Row>

   <Row ss:Index="10" ss:Height="28">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Test Case ID</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Test Case Description</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Test Case Procedure</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Expected Results</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Pre-conditions</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Round 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Round 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Round 3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Defect IDs</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="TableHeader"><Data ss:Type="String">Note</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.1: System Health &amp; Citizen Registration (GET /health, POST /api/v1/auth/register)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-001</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify overall connectivity between Ecolink.WebApi server and PostgreSQL via the /health endpoint.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Start Ecolink.WebApi.&#10;2. Send GET /health request without attaching a Bearer token.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK.&#10;- System responds with Healthy status, confirming Database connection is ready.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Ecolink.WebApi server and PostgreSQL ecolink_db are running.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Health_ReturnsOk</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="134">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-002</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify successful registration of a new Citizen account with valid data and automatic UserEcoProfile initialization.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Prepare JSON body with username=&quot;qa_&lt;unique&gt;&quot;, email=&quot;qa_&lt;unique&gt;@example.com&quot;, password=&quot;Passw0rd!23&quot;, fullName=&quot;QA Tester&quot;, phoneNumber=&quot;0912345678&quot;.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register.&#10;3. Verify response payload and records in users and user_eco_profiles tables.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK or 201 Created.&#10;- Envelope success = true, messageCode = &quot;MSG-AUTH-02&quot;.&#10;- data.user.username and data.user.email match input.&#10;- Simultaneously creates UserEcoProfile with treeLevel = 1, currentGreenPoints = 0.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">No duplicate username or email exists in the users table.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithValidData_Succeeds</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-003</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify Citizen account registration succeeds when omitting the optional phoneNumber field.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create valid registration JSON body without the phoneNumber field.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK / 201 Created.&#10;- success = true, account created with phoneNumber = null.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System is operating normally.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithoutOptionalPhoneNumber_Succeeds</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-004</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify upper and lower length boundaries for registration fields (username 50 chars, password 6 and 100 chars, fullName 100 chars).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register with username exactly 50 chars, password 100 chars, fullName 100 chars.&#10;2. Send a second registration request with password=&quot;abc123&quot; (exact 6-char lower bound).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Both requests return HTTP Status 200 OK / 201 Created.&#10;- success = true, no string truncation or PostgreSQL column overflow errors occur.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">No duplicate account exists in the DB.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithMaxLengthFields_Succeeds &amp; Register_WithMinLengthPassword_Succeeds</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-005</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify registration is blocked when username already exists in the DB (BR-AUTH-01).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Retrieve username of a previously registered account.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register with the same username and a new email.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 400 Bad Request.&#10;- success = false, messageCode = &quot;MSG-AUTH-01&quot;.&#10;- Message: &quot;This username already exists. Please choose another name.&quot;</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">First account already exists in the users table.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithDuplicateUsername_Fails</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-006</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify registration is blocked when email already exists in the DB (BR-AUTH-01).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Retrieve email of a previously registered account.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register with a new username and duplicate email.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 400 Bad Request.&#10;- success = false, messageCode = &quot;MSG-AUTH-01&quot;.&#10;- Message: &quot;This email is already in use. Please choose another email.&quot;</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Email already exists in the users table.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithDuplicateEmail_Fails</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-007</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify FluentValidation filter blocks 11 invalid registration data scenarios and empty body.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Sequentially send POST /api/v1/auth/register with 11 invalid variants: username 2 chars / 51 chars, malformed / empty email, password 5 chars / 101 chars, fullName 101 chars, missing required fields, or empty JSON {}.&#10;2. Observe HTTP response codes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- All requests return HTTP Status 400 Bad Request (or 415 if body is missing).&#10;- success = false, errors list details the violating fields.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System is operating normally.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_WithInvalidData_Returns400</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.2: Recycler Direct Registration (POST /api/v1/auth/register-recycler)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-008</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify direct Recycler partner registration simultaneously creates RecyclerProfile in Pending status with PostGIS coordinates.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Prepare payload containing account info and facility info (facilityName, representativeName, businessAddress, latitude=10.7769, longitude=106.7009, contactPhone).&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register-recycler.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK / 201 Created.&#10;- Creates users record (Role = Recycler, Status = PendingVerification) and recycler_profiles record (VerificationStatus = Pending, Location = Point(106.7009, 10.7769) SRID 4326).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">No duplicate username or email exists in the DB.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">RecyclerHelper.PendingRecyclerToken</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.3: User Login &amp; Brute-Force Lockout (POST /api/v1/auth/login)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-009</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify end-to-end Register -&gt; immediate Login using both username and email (case-insensitive).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/register to create a new account.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with usernameOrEmail = username.&#10;3. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with usernameOrEmail = email.ToUpper().</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Both login calls return HTTP Status 200 OK.&#10;- data.accessToken is non-empty, data.expiresAt &gt; UtcNow.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Account was successfully created in step 1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Register_ThenLogin_WorksWithUsernameAndEmail</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-010</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify successful login across 3 demo role accounts (citizen, collector, admin) and validate response payload structure.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Sequentially send POST /api/v1/auth/login for citizen, collector, and admin.&#10;2. Inspect fields inside data.user.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK, success = true.&#10;- data.user contains all required fields: id (UUID), username, role, currentGreenPoints, treeLevel, totalRecycledKg, isGoogleAuth.&#10;- No password or passwordHash is leaked in the response.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Demo accounts are pre-seeded in the DB.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Login_WithDemoAccount_Succeeds &amp; Login_ReturnsExpectedResponseShape</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-011</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify failed login with wrong password or non-existent account returns identical error response (BR-AUTH-03).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with usernameOrEmail=&quot;citizen&quot;, password=&quot;wrong-password&quot;.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with usernameOrEmail=&quot;nonexistent_user&quot;, password=&quot;whatever123&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Both cases return HTTP Status 400 Bad Request.&#10;- success = false, accessToken = null.&#10;- The message text in both cases is completely identical to prevent User Enumeration.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">citizen account exists in the DB.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Login_WithWrongPassword_Fails &amp; Login_ErrorMessage_DoesNotRevealWhichAccountsExist</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-012</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify 15-minute temporary account lockout mechanism after 5 consecutive wrong password attempts (BR-AUTH-04).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Register a new test account.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with an incorrect password 5 consecutive times.&#10;3. On attempt 6, send POST /api/v1/auth/login with the correct password.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- On the 5th failed attempt: returns 400 Bad Request, messageCode = &quot;MSG-AUTH-03&quot;, account transitions to Status = Locked, LockoutUntil = UtcNow + 15m.&#10;- On the 6th attempt (even with correct password): still rejected with MSG-AUTH-03.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Test account is in Active status with FailedLoginAttempts = 0.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">BR-AUTH-04 Integration Flow</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-013</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify login requests missing required fields or containing SQL Injection / XSS payloads are rejected.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/login with empty JSON {} or missing password.&#10;2. Send requests with usernameOrEmail = &quot;&apos; OR &apos;1&apos;=&apos;1&quot;, &quot;admin&apos;--&quot;, &quot;&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 400 Bad Request.&#10;- success = false, accessToken = null; EF Core parameterized queries completely block SQL Injection.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System is operating normally.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Login_WithInvalidBody_Returns400 &amp; Login_WithInjectionPayload_IsRejected</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.4: Current User Profile &amp; JWT Verification (GET /api/v1/auth/me)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="120">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-014</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify retrieving current user info via GET /api/v1/auth/me with Dual Auth (Bearer JWT or HttpOnly cookie accessToken) and direct DB Role Sync.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Log in to obtain JWT token (or HttpOnly cookie accessToken) for citizen, collector, admin, and an account recently approved for Citizen -&gt; Recycler upgrade.&#10;2. Send GET /api/v1/auth/me with Bearer token (or Cookie: accessToken=..., ?token=...).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK.&#10;- data.username, data.id, data.role, data.currentGreenPoints are queried directly from DB via AuthService.GetUserByTokenAsync -&gt; GetUserByIdAsync (reflecting latest Recycler role even if stale JWT role claim has not been reissued).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in with a valid JWT / accessToken cookie.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Me_WithValidToken_ReturnsCurrentUser (Dual Auth &amp; DB Role Sync)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-015</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify GET /api/v1/auth/me blocks requests without a token, with malformed tokens, or with tampered JWT signatures.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send GET /api/v1/auth/me without any token.&#10;2. Send with token &quot;abc&quot; or &quot;aaa.bbb.ccc&quot;.&#10;3. Take a valid JWT, alter the last 4 signature characters, and send GET /api/v1/auth/me.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- All cases return HTTP Status 401 Unauthorized.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System configures JwtBearerAuthentication validating HMAC-SHA256 signatures.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.Me_WithoutToken_Returns401 &amp; Me_WithTamperedToken_Returns401</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.5: Token Rotation, Password Recovery &amp; Profile Update (POST /refresh-token, /forgot-password, /reset-password, PUT /profile)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="120">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-016</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify Refresh Token rotation (POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token), HttpOnly Cookie fallback support, and Token Replay Attack detection (BR-AUTH-05).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Log in to obtain initial refreshToken (in body and/or 7-day HttpOnly cookie refreshToken).&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token with initial refreshToken -&gt; receive second token pair.&#10;3. Resend initial (revoked) refreshToken to /api/v1/auth/refresh-token.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Step 2: returns 200 OK, issues new accessToken and refreshToken (also updates SetAuthCookies for browser sessions without X-EcoLink-No-Cookie header).&#10;- Step 3: detects Replay Attack, returns 400/401 with messageCode = &quot;MSG-AUTH-10&quot;, and revokes the entire Refresh Token family for that user.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">User is logged in and holds a valid refreshToken in refresh_tokens table.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">BR-AUTH-05 Token Rotation</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify Forgot Password (POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password), 60s Rate Limit (BR-AUTH-09), and Reset Password (POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password) flow.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password with test account email.&#10;2. Repeat request immediately within 60 seconds.&#10;3. Use generated OTP/Token to call POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password with newPassword=&quot;NewPass!2026&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Step 1: 200 OK (MSG-AUTH-08), stores PasswordResetToken with 15-minute expiry.&#10;- Step 2: blocks duplicate email dispatch within 60s (BR-AUTH-09).&#10;- Step 3: 200 OK (MSG-AUTH-09), updates password and revokes previous login sessions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Test account exists in users table.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">BR-AUTH-09 &amp; BR-AUTH-06</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-018</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify personal profile update (PUT /api/v1/auth/profile), password change (POST /api/v1/auth/change-password), and logout (POST /api/v1/auth/logout clearing HttpOnly Cookies).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send PUT /api/v1/auth/profile updating fullName and phoneNumber.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/change-password with currentPassword and newPassword.&#10;3. Send POST /api/v1/auth/logout revoking refreshToken.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- All 3 steps return 200 OK.&#10;- Profile info updates in DB; refreshToken after logout has isRevoked = true and ClearAuthCookies clears session cookies (accessToken, refreshToken, ecolink_session_active).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">User is validly authenticated.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Authenticated Account Lifecycle</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 1.6: Demo Accounts &amp; VietQR Partner Token (GET /demo-users, POST /vietqr-token)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify retrieving demo account list (GET /api/v1/auth/demo-users) does not expose passwordHash.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send GET /api/v1/auth/demo-users.&#10;2. Inspect returned JSON payload.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK.&#10;- List is non-empty and JSON string strictly does not contain &quot;passwordhash&quot; or &quot;password_hash&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System is operating normally.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.DemoUsers_DoesNotExposePasswordHash</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AUTH-020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify Basic Auth security on VietQR partner gateway (POST /api/v1/auth/vietqr-token) rejects unauthenticated requests or requests using a user JWT.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/auth/vietqr-token without Authorization header.&#10;2. Send POST /api/v1/auth/vietqr-token with a citizen Bearer JWT.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Both cases are rejected with HTTP Status 401 Unauthorized (endpoint requires VietQR ClientId:ClientSecret Basic Auth).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">System is operating normally.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AuthTests.VietQrToken_WithUserBearerToken_Returns401</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
  </Table>
 </Worksheet>

