    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeftBold"><Data ss:Type="String">AI Waste Classification &amp; Rule Engine (M02_WasteScan)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">Integration testing of Smart Waste Recognition &amp; Classification using YOLO26 Two-Stage (yolo26_detect) &amp; 10 canonical waste categories (U-04), synchronized with 16 FastAPI endpoints (/api/v1/*, /health, /), verifying available AI models catalog (GET /models), Rule Engine sorting rules (GET /rules, GET /waste-categories), personal scan history (GET /history), waste category administration (POST/PUT/PATCH /waste-categories), rule publishing (PUT/PATCH /rules), misclassification feedback (POST /feedback), and blocking pricing for non-recyclable/hazardous waste categories (BR-MTH-03) (EcoLink.ApiTests/WasteScanTests.cs).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
