   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-AI-020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-end Admin management lifecycle: Create category (201) -&gt; Edit category (200) -&gt; Configure draft Rule (PUT) -&gt; Publish Rule (PATCH /publish) -&gt; Soft-delete Inactive (PATCH /status).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Admin sequentially calls POST/PUT /waste-categories, PUT /waste-scan/rules/{catId}, PATCH /publish, PATCH /status.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">All steps return 201/200; Rule transitions DRAFT -&gt; ACTIVE; category becomes Inactive without hard deletion (BR-SRT-01..04).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in as Admin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">WasteScanTests.Admin_CategoryAndRuleEngineLifecycle_WorksEndToEnd</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 2.5: Extended 10-Category Classification &amp; Non-Tradable Pricing Protection (BR-MTH-03)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="148">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-SCN-021</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify YOLO26 Two-Stage (yolo26_detect) classification for 4 extended categories (battery, biological, clothes, shoes) with 12-class detect -&gt; 10 canonical CLASS_NAMES mapping and WasteRuleEngineService handling rules.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Submit sample images for battery, biological, clothes, and shoes via POST /api/v1/waste-scan/classify with model yolo26_detect (OOD threshold 0.60, mapping brown-glass/green-glass/white-glass -&gt; glass).&#10;2. Verify guidance returned alongside prediction and from GET /api/v1/waste-scan/rules and GET /api/v1/waste-categories.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 200 OK.&#10;- Returns exact labels belonging to 10 CLASS_NAMES (battery, biological, clothes, shoes) with standardBinColor (Red Hazardous, Green, Purple Secondhand), preparationSteps, handlingAction, hazardWarning (battery fire/explosion &amp; hazardous waste warnings), and isRecyclable = false (safe disposal/donation instructions, not weighed for purchase).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">AI Service loaded yolo26_detect; WasteRuleEngineService.DefaultSeeds seeded all 10 standard categories.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">model_manager.py (10 CLASS_NAMES) &amp; WasteRuleEngineService.DefaultSeeds</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="120">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-SCN-022</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify blocking Recyclers from configuring purchase prices for non-recyclable/hazardous categories (battery, biological, trash, clothes, shoes) per BR-MTH-03.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Log in as a KYB-verified Recycler.&#10;2. Query ids of battery, biological, trash (isRecyclable = false) from GET /api/v1/waste-categories.&#10;3. Send POST /api/v1/recycler/prices (or PUT /api/v1/recycler/prices) configuring unit prices for these non-purchasable categories.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- HTTP Status: 400 Bad Request.&#10;- success = false, messageCode = &quot;MSG-GEN-01&quot; (BR-MTH-03).&#10;- Message: &quot;This waste category only supports disposal guidance and is not a purchasable recyclable category.&quot; - no price record is created in DB.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Categories battery, biological, trash (isRecyclable = false) exist and Recycler account is verified.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">RecyclerManagementService.EnsurePurchasable (BR-MTH-03)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
  </Table>
 </Worksheet>

