    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeftBold"><Data ss:Type="String">Recycler Onboarding &amp; Verification (M03_Onboarding)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-end integration testing of Recycler Onboarding &amp; KYB Verification (U-17, S-04): Upload business license &amp; facility photo to Cloudflare R2/Local (POST /upload-document), Citizen submits upgrade application (POST /recycler-applications), track verification status (GET /me), Staff/Admin inspect queue &amp; application details, Reject with reason (MSG-MTH-05) allowing resubmission, and Approve (MSG-MTH-04) automatically upgrading Role to Recycler (Module 1) while seeding default prices (Module 4) (EcoLink.ApiTests/OnboardingTests.cs).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="20">
