    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeftBold"><Data ss:Type="String">Location-Based Recycler Discovery (M05_Discovery)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-end integration testing of Location-Based Recycler Discovery (U-05): PostGIS/Haversine spatial query within radius R in [0.5, 50] km (GET /api/v1/recyclers/nearby), displaying only Verified + Online facilities (BR-MTH-01, BR-MTH-02), filtering by waste category &amp; keyword (BR-MTH-07), sorting by ascending distance (BR-MTH-04) or highest unit price (price_desc), radius expansion fallback suggestion when zero results found (MSG-MTH-01), public facility detail page (GET /api/v1/recyclers/{id}), nearby trade partners (GET /api/v1/trade/partners/nearby), and Geocoding Proxy (GET /api/v1/geocoding/search) (EcoLink.ApiTests/DiscoveryTests.cs).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="20">
