    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeftBold"><Data ss:Type="String">In-System Service Packages &amp; VietQR Integration (M12_ServicePackages)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-End integration testing for 15 APIs in module M-12: RBAC 401/403 enforcement, 3-tier pricing catalog (BASIC/PREMIUM/PRO), 15-minute dynamic VietQR generation &amp; order cancellation, idempotent Webhook handling &amp; signature verification (BR-PAY-02), 5 anomaly scenarios, 4-criteria PRO eligibility validation (ProEligibilityReportDto - BR-PAY-03, BR-PAY-04), live DB Recycler role sync regardless of stale User JWT claims, package fee configuration &amp; Grandfathering (BR-PAY-05), and financial reconciliation / PII-anonymized statement export (BR-PAY-06, BR-ADM-06).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="20">
