   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-End integration testing for the Human-in-the-Loop Active Learning cycle: SHA-256 scan image tracking &amp; automatic OOD collection &lt; 60% (BR-CLS-03), blocking Inactive/non-existent categories (BR-CLS-02) &amp; duplicate ScanId (BR-CLS-05), fine-grained permissions REVIEW_AI vs CURATE_DATASET (BR-ADM-02, MSG-ADM-04), one-tap approval / rejection (BR-CLS-06), YOLO labeling &amp; atomic batch assignment, leakage-free Sticky Stratified Split 70/20/10 algorithm (BR-CLS-07), YOLO-format .zip export &amp; FastAPI synchronization (STT 216–217).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="20">
