   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 11.1: Scan History Persistence &amp; Misclassification Feedback (U-04 — STT 021, 024, 148)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-001</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Scan an image to create AiScanHistory (scanId, imageUrl) and submit misclassification feedback to PostgreSQL (MSG-CLS-06).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Register a Citizen and send a PNG image to POST /api/v1/waste-scan/classify.&#10;2. Retrieve scanId and submit POST /api/v1/waste-scan/feedback (userReportedLabel=&quot;plastic&quot;).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">classify returns scanId &amp; imageUrl; feedback returns 200 OK (MSG-CLS-06), status=&quot;Pending&quot;, normalizedLabel=&quot;plastic&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">WebApi, Postgres &amp; FastAPI are running.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS01</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-002</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Automatically collect OOD / low-confidence samples (&lt; 60%) into the LowConfidenceAuto (Unlabeled) queue.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Scan a monochrome 32x32 PNG image.&#10;2. Call GET /api/v1/staff/ai-labeling/queue?sourceType=LowConfidenceAuto.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">When isOutOfDistribution=true, a record with sourceScanId == scanId &amp; status=&quot;Unlabeled&quot; is found.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin permission to read the queue.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS02</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-003</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Reject misclassification feedback with a non-existent category label (BR-CLS-02).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /api/v1/waste-scan/feedback with userReportedLabel=&quot;nuclear_waste&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">HTTP 400 Bad Request, success=false.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in as Citizen.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS03</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-004</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Reject duplicate misclassification feedback for the same scanId (BR-CLS-05).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Scan an image to obtain scanId.&#10;2. Send POST /feedback with the same scanId twice consecutively.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">First request returns 200 OK; second request returns 409 Conflict.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Valid scanId exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS04</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 11.2: Fine-Grained RBAC &amp; Misclassification Review (S-01 — STT 149–151)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="120">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-005</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Enforce 401 authentication &amp; fine-grained [HasPermission] RBAC between REVIEW_AI and CURATE_DATASET (MSG-ADM-04).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Call feedback/me, staff/ai-feedback, and staff/ai-datasets without a token (401) and with a Citizen token (403).&#10;2. Create 3 Staff accounts with MANAGE_BLOG, REVIEW_AI, and CURATE_DATASET permissions and attempt cross-endpoint calls.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">REVIEW_AI can only access ai-feedback; CURATE_DATASET can only access ai-datasets; missing permissions return 403 MSG-ADM-04.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin account grants RBAC permissions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS05</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-006</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">One-tap ApproveAndLabel review promotes item to VerifiedLabeled with YOLO bounding box &amp; records AuditLog.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen submits feedback for paper.&#10;2. Staff [REVIEW_AI] calls PATCH /staff/ai-feedback/{id}/review (ApproveAndLabel, verifiedLabel=&quot;paper&quot;, 1 box).&#10;3. Check /admin/audit-logs?action=REVIEW_AI_FEEDBACK.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">HTTP 200 MSG-CLS-07, status=&quot;Reviewed&quot;, datasetItemStatus=&quot;VerifiedLabeled&quot;, AuditLog contains a record matching reportId.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff has REVIEW_AI permission.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS06</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-007</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Rejecting noisy images requires a reason &gt;= 5 characters and creates no Dataset item (BR-CLS-06).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Attempt Reject with reviewNote=&quot;Blur&quot; (400).&#10;2. Submit Reject with a valid reason &gt;= 5 characters.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Step 1: 400 Bad Request. Step 2: 200 OK, status=&quot;Rejected&quot;, datasetItemId=null.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Pending feedback report exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS07</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-008</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Isolate /waste-scan/feedback/me list (BR-CLS-08) and block re-reviewing an already processed report (409).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen A submits a feedback report; Citizen B calls GET /feedback/me to verify.&#10;2. Admin approves once (ApproveToQueue) and then attempts a second review.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen B cannot see Citizen A&apos;s report; second review returns 409 Conflict.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Two Citizen accounts A and B exist.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS08</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 11.3: Ground-Truth Annotation &amp; Atomic Batch Assign (S-02 — STT 152–154)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-009</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Assign Ground-Truth label &amp; YOLO bounding box [0, 1] via PUT /api/v1/staff/ai-labeling/{itemId}.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Place a sample into the Unlabeled queue.&#10;2. Send PUT with groundTruthLabel=&quot;metal&quot; &amp; 1 box [0.5, 0.5, 0.3, 0.4].</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">HTTP 200 OK, status=&quot;VerifiedLabeled&quot;, yoloAnnotations.Length=1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">An Unlabeled sample exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS09</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="38">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-010</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Reject out-of-bounds YOLO coordinates (0, 1] during labeling.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send PUT /ai-labeling/{itemId} with xCenter=1.25, width=0.0.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">HTTP 400 Bad Request.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A DatasetItem sample exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS10</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-011</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Atomic batch labeling (POST /batch-assign): succeeds for a 3-image batch &amp; rolls back on an invalid ID.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Prepare 3 Unlabeled samples.&#10;2. Call /batch-assign including 1 Guid.NewGuid() (404).&#10;3. Verify all 3 samples remain Unlabeled, then call with 3 valid IDs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">First call returns 404 Not Found &amp; rolls back all 3; second call returns 200 OK, updatedCount=3.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">3 Unlabeled samples exist.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS11</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 11.4: Sticky Stratified Split 70/20/10, ZIP Export &amp; FastAPI Sync (S-03 — STT 155–157, 216–217)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-012</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Package a stratified 70/20/10 Dataset version &amp; enforce mandatory 100% ratio sum.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Prepare multi-class VerifiedLabeled samples (plastic, paper, metal).&#10;2. Try 70/20/5 split ratio (400), then create 70/20/10 (201).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Invalid sum returns 400; valid split returns 201 Created (MSG-CLS-08), trainCount &gt; valCount &gt;= testCount &gt;= 1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff [CURATE_DATASET].</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS12</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-013</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify Sticky Split Zero Data Leakage across consecutive versions (v1 -&gt; v2).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create v1 and export manifest.json storing itemId -&gt; split mapping.&#10;2. Add 5 new samples, create v2, and export manifest.json for comparison.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">100% of samples present in v1 retain the exact same split assignment in v2.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">VerifiedLabeled samples exist.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS13</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-014</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Retrieve curated dataset statistics via GET /staff/ai-datasets &amp; compute class imbalance ratio (ImbalanceRatio &gt; 2.5x).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Add plastic samples exceeding &gt; 2.5x the count of glass samples.&#10;2. Call GET /api/v1/staff/ai-datasets.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Returns accurate summary.imbalanceRatio and sets isBalanced=false when exceeding the 2.50x threshold.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">At least 2 classes have samples.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS14</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-015</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Export YOLO-format .zip package with Header X-EcoLink-Message-Code: MSG-ADM-02.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Call GET /staff/ai-datasets/versions/{id}/export?format=yolo.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">200 OK (application/zip), header contains MSG-ADM-02, .zip contains data.yaml &amp; manifest.json.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Dataset version exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS15</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-CLS-016</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Sync Dataset version to FastAPI (POST /api/v1/datasets/curate) transitioning status to SyncedToAi.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send POST /versions with syncToAiService=true while AI Service (:8000) is running.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">201 Created, status=&quot;SyncedToAi&quot; and syncedToAiAt != null.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">AI Service is running.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AiCurationTests.CLS16</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
  </Table>
 </Worksheet>

 <!-- ==================== SHEET 15: M11_ReviewsComplaints ==================== -->
 <Worksheet ss:Name="M11_ReviewsComplaints">
