   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-End integration testing for 7 Use Cases U-13, U-14, U-15, S-09, S-10, A-07, A-08: RBAC across Citizen, Recycler, Staff [MANAGE_INVENTORY] and Admin; ICT daily check-in + Streak + non-transaction daily cap (BR-GAM-02, BR-GAM-09); Point wallet &amp; idempotent ledger (BR-GAM-01, BR-GAM-03); Concurrent gift redemption preventing overselling/negative balance (BR-GAM-04, BR-GAM-05); R2 gift image upload, stock restock &amp; E-Voucher import / Fulfill-Cancel (S-10); Citizen-only Virtual Tree daily care (/tree/care), fruit harvest (/tree/harvest), and level upgrade unlocking Eco Facts (BR-GAM-06, BR-GAM-08); Configuration &amp; reset to defaults (config/reset, A-07) + Leaderboard cycle edit/activate/Top 3 finalization (A-08, BR-GAM-07).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
