   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 13.1: Daily Check-in, Streak &amp; Non-Transaction Daily Cap (U-13 — STT 077–081)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-001</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Enforce RBAC for Check-in (Citizen &amp; Recycler), Virtual Tree (Citizen only), Staff [MANAGE_INVENTORY], and Admin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send unauthenticated requests (401) and have Citizen call Staff/Admin routes (403).&#10;2. Recycler calls /check-in (200) and /virtual-tree (403).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Complies with BR-GAM-08 &amp; [HasPermission] authorization matrix.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Accounts for all 4 roles are ready.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamAccessTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-002</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Verify initial check-in status, perform ICT Check-in, and credit points into UserPointWallet.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Register a clean user (FreshUserAsync).&#10;2. Call GET /gamification/check-in/status -&gt; POST /gamification/check-in.&#10;3. Read GET /gamification/profile/me &amp; /points/ledger.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Status before check-in is checkedInToday=false; after check-in, +5 pts awarded, streakCount=1, matching profile/me.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Default config (base=5, cap=50).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCheckinTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-003</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Block duplicate check-in on the same ICT day (BR-GAM-09).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Complete check-in 1 successfully (200).&#10;2. Immediately send a second POST /api/v1/gamification/check-in.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Second attempt is rejected with 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01); wallet is not double-credited.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Already checked in today.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCheckinTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-004</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Clamp points by DailyNonTransactionCap when Cap &lt; CheckinReward.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Admin sets DailyNonTransactionCap = 3 via PUT /admin/gamification/config.&#10;2. New user calls POST /check-in.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Only 3 pts received, limitedByDailyCap=true; config restored after test.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in as Admin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCheckinTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 13.2: Points Wallet, Ledger, Gift Store &amp; Atomic Concurrency (U-14 — STT 088–095)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-005</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Completing a scrap handover (M-07) simultaneously credits both Citizen &amp; Recycler wallets with idempotent ledger entries.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen creates &amp; completes a 10kg HandoverRequest.&#10;2. Check /points/wallet &amp; /gamification/points/ledger for both parties.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Both Citizen &amp; Recycler wallets increase by the expected rate/kg (ActionType=&quot;Handover_Reward&quot;).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Completed order exists in M-07.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamPointTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-006</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Redeeming an E-Voucher returns a unique ECO-... code, sets ExpiresAt per voucherValidityDays &amp; verifies /redemptions/{id} isolation.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create a Voucher gift (points=10, stock=5).&#10;2. User redeems gift -&gt; verify voucherCode, expiresAt &amp; another user calls GET /redemptions/{id}.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Returns 201 MSG-GAM-02, code ECO-..., status=&quot;Redeemed&quot;; another user accessing it gets 404.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">User has enough points to redeem.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-007</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Redeeming a Physical gift requires deliveryAddress &amp; creates a Pending order.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Attempt to redeem a Physical gift with empty deliveryAddress (400).&#10;2. Resubmit with a valid address.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Missing address returns 400 MSG-AUTH-02; valid address returns 201, status=&quot;Pending&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Physical gift is in stock.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-008</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Concurrency test (Race Condition): 2 users compete to redeem 1 last gift item (stock = 1).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create 2 users each with 100 pts and a gift with stock=1, price=40.&#10;2. Fire Task.WhenAll(Redeem A, Redeem B) concurrently.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Exactly 1 succeeds (201) and the other fails with 400 MSG-GAM-04; stock=0, combined wallet balance = 160.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">PostgreSQL Transaction enabled.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-009</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Concurrency test (Double Spend): 1 user (100 pts) fires 4 parallel requests to redeem a 60 pts gift.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Fire 4 parallel POST /redeem calls using the same single token.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Only 1 request returns 201, remaining balance is 40 pts (never negative BR-GAM-03), stock decreases by exactly 1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">User has 100 pts.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 13.3: Virtual Tree, Eco Facts &amp; Staff Content/Inventory (U-15, S-09, S-10 — STT 082–087, 096–112)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-010</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff creates/updates/toggles &amp; soft-deletes EcoFact; validates title length limit &amp; image URL (S-09).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Staff sends title &gt; 200 characters or invalid URL (400).&#10;2. Create level-2 EcoFact, toggle INACTIVE/ACTIVE &amp; DELETE.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Invalid inputs blocked with 400; valid EcoFact is saved and filtered accurately via /staff/eco-facts.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff [MANAGE_INVENTORY].</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamFactTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-011</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen waters / upgrades Virtual Tree (POST /gamification/tree/upgrade), unlocks EcoFact &amp; blocks Recycler.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen with 150 pts calls POST /gamification/tree/upgrade.&#10;2. Call /gamification/eco-facts/me &amp; check wallet point deduction.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Advances to level 2, returns level-2 unlockedFacts; deducts 100 pts; exceeding DailyTreeCareLimit in a day is blocked with 400.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen has enough points &amp; daily care quota.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamTreeTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-012</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Concurrent Virtual Tree upgrade prevents double-spend &amp; blocks level downgrade or level skipping (BR-GAM-06).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen with 500 pts fires 2 concurrent /upgrade requests from level 1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Exactly 1 request succeeds to level 2, deducting points only once.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Tree is at level 1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamTreeTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-013</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff manages gift inventory: create, update without overwriting stock, restock, toggle INACTIVE &amp; store filtering (S-10).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Staff creates gift -&gt; updates name/points -&gt; calls /restock (+10) -&gt; toggles INACTIVE.&#10;2. User calls GET /gifts &amp; attempts to redeem INACTIVE gift.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Stock increments accurately; INACTIVE gift disappears from store &amp; redemption is blocked with 400 MSG-GAM-04.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff [MANAGE_INVENTORY].</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="50">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-014</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff bulk-imports E-Voucher codes (POST /vouchers/import) &amp; deduplicates codes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create a Voucher gift with stock=1.&#10;2. Staff sends POST /staff/gifts/{id}/vouchers/import with 2 new codes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">200 OK, importedCount=2, stockQuantity increases to 3.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Gift has Type=&quot;Voucher&quot;.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCanonicalTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-015</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff views redemption queue /staff/redemptions, fulfills delivery (Fulfill) &amp; blocks duplicate fulfillment (S-10).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Redeem a Physical gift -&gt; Staff calls GET /staff/redemptions -&gt; POST .../fulfill.&#10;2. Call fulfill a second time.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">First call returns 200 (Status=&quot;Delivered&quot;); second call is blocked with 400 MSG-GEN-01.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Pending Physical redemption order exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamGiftTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-016</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff cancels redemption order (action=&quot;Cancel&quot;), fully refunding wallet points &amp; restoring stock (S-10).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen (150 pts) redeems a 25 pts Physical gift (125 pts remaining).&#10;2. Staff calls PATCH /staff/redemptions/{id}/fulfill { action: &quot;Cancel&quot; }.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Order becomes Cancelled, balance is refunded to 150 pts, stock increases by +1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">A Pending redemption order exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCanonicalTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 13.4: Admin Config (A-07) &amp; Leaderboard Cycles (A-08) — STT 079, 113–120</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin configures points/kg rates &amp; tree level thresholds (PUT /admin/gamification/config), rejects invalid thresholds &amp; logs AuditLog.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Send non-sequential tree level thresholds (400) or delete a level with an ACTIVE EcoFact (400).&#10;2. Save valid configuration &amp; inspect /admin/audit-logs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Invalid config blocked with 400; valid config returns 200 and logs GAMIFICATION_CONFIG_UPDATE.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in as Admin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamConfigTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-018</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin creates, updates &amp; switches leaderboard cycles (POST/PUT/PATCH /leaderboard-cycles) preserving at most 1 active cycle (A-08).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create cycle A (isActive=true) and cycle B (isActive=true).&#10;2. Call GET /admin/gamification/leaderboard-cycles.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Cycle B becomes active while cycle A automatically deactivates (isActive=false), satisfying the DB partial unique index.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in as Admin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCanonicalTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizens view public leaderboard (GET /gamification/leaderboard) by cycle &amp; display myEntry excluding Recyclers.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Point transactions and an Active cycle exist.&#10;2. Guest &amp; Citizen call GET /gamification/leaderboard?top=10&amp;cycleId=...</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Returns 200 OK with activeCycle, User-only filtered list, and myEntry when authenticated.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Cycle &amp; point transaction data exist.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCanonicalTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="64">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin finalizes leaderboard cycle (POST .../finalize), awards Top 3 bonuses &amp; prevents duplicate finalization (A-08).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Create a weekly cycle -&gt; Admin calls POST /leaderboard-cycles/{id}/finalize.&#10;2. Call finalize a second time.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">First call returns 200 (Status=&quot;Finalized&quot;) and saves Winners snapshot; second call is blocked with 400.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">An unfinalized cycle exists.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamCanonicalTests</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="9" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">Function 13.5: Extended Virtual Tree Care, Fruit Harvest, Gift Upload/Restock &amp; Config/Cycle Controls</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="176">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-021</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen performs daily tree care (POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/care / /virtual-tree/care): watering revival/moisture saturation, golden-zone fertilizing x1.4 EXP, blocking over daily limit while still allowing paid upgrades (POST .../upgrade).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Citizen calls POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/care with actionType = &quot;water&quot; (wilted 0% tree revives +35% moisture, +10 EXP; blocked when moisture &gt;= 95%) and &quot;fertilize&quot; (blocked when moisture &lt; 30%, 60–90% zone grants +35 EXP vs +25 EXP, -10% moisture, uses FertilizerPacks after free quota).&#10;2. Set dailyTreeCareLimit = 1, water 2 times on the same day, then call POST /api/v1/virtual-tree/water (/gamification/tree/upgrade).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Valid watering/fertilizing returns 200 OK (MSG-GAM-06); exceeding daily limit or violating biological thresholds (&gt;= 95%, &lt; 30%, 0%) is blocked with 400 MSG-GEN-01.&#10;- Exhausting daily free /care actions still allows upgrading tree level using GreenPoints (POST /gamification/tree/upgrade -&gt; 200 OK).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen has a virtual tree at an eligible level &amp; sufficient GreenPoints.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GamTreeTests.Water_DailyLimit_BlocksFurtherCare_WhileAllowingPaidUpgrade &amp; VirtualTreeService.CareAsync</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="134">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-022</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Citizen harvests ripe fruit (POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/harvest / /virtual-tree/harvest), converting full EXP bar into GreenPoints under BR-GAM-02 daily cap.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Attempt POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/harvest when CareExp is not full (!HarvestReady) or tree is wilted at 0% (400).&#10;2. Care for tree until HarvestReady = true, then call POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/harvest (comparing before and after hitting DailyNonTransactionCap).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Ineligible state: returns 400 MSG-GEN-01 (or 400 BR-GAM-02 MSG-GAM-05 if daily cap is reached).&#10;- Valid harvest: returns 200 OK (MSG-GAM-06), credits pointsAwarded to UserPointWallet, resets careExp = 0 and harvestReady = false, increments totalHarvested, and prevents concurrent duplicate harvests.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Tree has accumulated full CareExp (HarvestReady = true) and moisture &gt; 0%.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">UserGamificationController.Harvest &amp; VirtualTreeService.HarvestAsync</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="134">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-023</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff uploads gift image (POST /api/v1/staff/gifts/upload-image) and adds inventory stock (POST /api/v1/staff/gifts/{id}/restock).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Staff attempts uploading an empty file, a .txt/non-.jpg/.jpeg/.png/.webp file, or &gt; 5 MB file to POST /api/v1/staff/gifts/upload-image (400); then uploads a valid PNG (200).&#10;2. Staff calls POST /api/v1/staff/gifts/{id}/restock with quantity = 5, quantity &lt;= 0 (0, -3), and a non-existent id.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Valid image returns 200 OK with fileUrl under prefix gamification-gifts (invalid format returns 400 MSG-CLS-01, over 5 MB returns 400 MSG-CLS-02).&#10;- Positive restock increments stockQuantity accurately (200); &lt;= 0 returns 400 Bad Request; unknown id returns 404 Not Found.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Staff has MANAGE_INVENTORY permission.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">StaffGamificationController.UploadGiftImage &amp; GamGiftInventoryTests.Restock_AddsToStock / Restock_NonPositive_Returns400 / Restock_Unknown_Returns404</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="148">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">ITC-GAM-024</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Admin updates &amp; activates leaderboard cycles (PUT /leaderboard-cycles/{id}, PATCH .../activate) and resets configuration to defaults (POST /config/reset).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">1. Admin calls PUT /api/v1/admin/gamification/leaderboard-cycles/{cycleId} to edit an unfinalized cycle&apos;s name/rewards, and PATCH /api/v1/admin/gamification/leaderboard-cycles/{cycleId}/activate to activate another cycle.&#10;2. Modify dailyNonTransactionCap, pointRates, and dailyTreeCareLimit via PUT /config, then call POST /api/v1/admin/gamification/config/reset.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">- Step 1: 200 OK, updates cycle metadata accurately and preserves exactly 1 cycle with isActive = true.&#10;- Step 2: POST /config/reset returns 200 OK, restoring exact default parameters (dailyNonTransactionCap = 50, checkinBasePoints = 5, dailyTreeCareLimit = 3, voucherValidityDays = 30, defaultPointsPerKg = 10, pointRates = [], 4 tree levels [0, 100, 300, 700]).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellItalic"><Data ss:Type="String">Logged in with Admin account.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">AdminGamificationController &amp; GamConfigTests.Get_AfterReset_ReturnsDefaults / Put_ValidChange_IsPersisted_ThenResetRestores</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
  </Table>
 </Worksheet>

