   <Row ss:Index="2" ss:Height="22">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Feature</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeftBold"><Data ss:Type="String">Blog &amp; Content Management (M14_BlogContent)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="106">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="SummaryLabel"><Data ss:Type="String">Test requirement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="3" ss:StyleID="SummaryValueLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">End-to-End integration testing for 3 Use Cases G-01, S-08, A-09: Dynamic [HasPermission(&quot;MANAGE_BLOG&quot;)] &amp; Admin authorization (BR-ADM-02); Cloudflare R2 blog-media image upload (&lt;= 5MB, .jpg/.png/.webp); Drafting, author detail view (GET /staff/blogs/{id}), deduplicated Vietnamese slug generation (ux_blog_posts_slug), editing &amp; deleting drafts; Submitting for approval (Draft -&gt; Pending_Approval) &amp; Recalling (POST /staff/blogs/{id}/recall: Pending_Approval -&gt; Draft); Admin moderation queue (oldest/newest), detail view (GET /admin/blogs/{id}), approving/rejecting via both /review endpoint and dedicated /approve (MSG-ADM-05) &amp; /reject endpoints with mandatory feedback (Draft, RejectionReason) + AuditLog recording (BR-ADM-05); Public portal hiding unapproved posts, exact JSON tag matching, and preventing internal metadata leakage (BR-ADM-08).</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
